</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/56667ce0-7ebf-11f1-9cce-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26189620694912.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/56667ce0-7ebf-11f1-9cce-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26189620694912.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f5e26254-80f2-11f1-8edd-9152da9232bb</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 09:05:45 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/56667ce0-7ebf-11f1-9cce-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26189620694912.jpg">© 美联社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>政治</category><title>就向中国情报人员泄露受限信息做虚假陈述 美联储前高级顾问被判囚38个月</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB/20260716-%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%91%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E5%8F%97%E9%99%90%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%81%9A%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0-%E7%BE%8E%E8%81%94%E5%82%A8%E5%89%8D%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E9%A1%BE%E9%97%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%A4%E5%9B%9A38%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88</link><description>
